# Wooden shingle roof (solid; Musikpavillon roof, house roofs): courses of
# 4 px shingles O with l joints and l course shadows, one lighter o
# shingle per course. Exposed top = light o lip; exposed left = lit o
# barge edge; exposed right = l; exposed bottom = eave board O between l.
# Autotiled (D-020): anim `auto`, frame = neighbour mask
# (1 = same tile above, 2 = right, 4 = below, 8 = left; level edge = same).
sprite = tile_roof_shingle
size   = 16x16
origin = 0,0
anim   = auto frames=16 ticks=1
